# Force source files to be treated as TEXT in diffs, so a stray byte never makes
# a file "Binary files differ" — which blinds the agentic reviewer/maintainer
# (it can't read an opaque diff and escalates). See the maintainer.mjs NUL bug.
*.mjs   text
*.ts    text
*.js    text
*.cjs   text
*.mts   text
*.json  text
*.md    text
*.yml   text
*.yaml  text
*.sh    text
